				<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">외국인 유학생 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">[</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">대학원</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">] </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">학년도&nbsp;신</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">편</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">입학 안내 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">(2022.3</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">입학</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">)<br></span></p>
<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">●</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: 굴림;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">원서접수 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">: 2021. 11. 8.(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">월</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">) 09:00 ~ 11.19.(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">금</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">) 17:00, <span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">TOPIK 4급 필수&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">● </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">면접 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">: 2021. 11. 24.(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">수</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">예정</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">● </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">합겨자 발표 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">: 2021. 12.1 (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">수</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">예정</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">● </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">가톨릭관동대학교 대학원 모집 안내 링크</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"></span><a href="https://www.cku.ac.kr/grad/4424/subview.do"><u style="text-underline: #0000ff single;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">https://www.cku.ac.kr/grad/4424/subview.do</span></u></a></p>
<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">● </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">문의 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">: </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">대학원 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">033-649-7162, 7172</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><br></span></p><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"> 
<p class="0"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">-----------------------------------------------------------</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">■ </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">입학절차 </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">(</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">해외 </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">-&gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">국내 입학인 경우</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; word-break: keep-all;">&nbsp;</p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">※ </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">대상 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">:</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">부모 모두 외국인이며 본인은 외국 국적 소지자로</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">한국어능력</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">(TOPIK)4</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">급 취득자</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">학교에서 자가격리장소 제공 불가능하므로</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">입국 후 스스로 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">10</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">박 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">11</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">일 자가격리해결 가능해야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">. </span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (유학 비자로 입국하는 사람은&nbsp;해외에서 백신접종을 완료하였어도 &nbsp;자가격리대상입니다. )</span></p></span>
<p class="0"><br></p><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"> 
