<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">3. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">합격 확인 및 등록금 납부</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">본인이 직접 학교 홈페이지에 수험번호를 입력하여 확인</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">대학원에서 별도 통보 안함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">등록금은 기한 내에 지정계좌로 송금</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">등록금 송금 확인서</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">대학원 합격증 사본 국제교류교육원 전달</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 161.25px; height: 122px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">학 생</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 503.75px; height: 55px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">4. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">표준입학허가서 발급 및 송부</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">등록금 완납 확인 후 표준입학허가서 발급</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 161.25px; height: 55px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">국제교류교육원</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 503.75px; height: 56px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">5. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국 소재 관할 한국대사관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영사관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">에 사증 신청</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">표준입학허가서</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">여권</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">기타서류 제출</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 161.25px; height: 56px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">학 생</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 503.75px; height: 92px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">6. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">사증 수령 후 개강 전 한국 입국</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">학교에서 자가격리장소 제공 불가능하므로</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">입국 후 스스로 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">10</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">박 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">11</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">일 자가격리 해결가능 해야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">개강 전까지 자가격리가 종료될 수 있도록 일정을 고려하여 입국해야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 161.25px; height: 92px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">학 생</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> </span>
<p><br></p>
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><br></span></p><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">■ </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">표준입학허가서 발급 안내&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"> (</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">해외 </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">-&gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">국내 입학인 경우</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">)</span></span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><br></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">1. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">발급 대상</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">부모 모두 외국인이며</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">본인은 외국 국적을 소지한 자</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">우리대학 대학원 최종 합격 후 등록금을 완납한 자</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; - <span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">학교에서 자가격리장소 제공 불가능하므로</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">입국 후 스스로 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">10</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">박 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">11</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">일 자가격리해결 가능한 자</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">2. </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">해당 비자 종류 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">: D-2(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">유학</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">국제교류교육원 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&lsquo;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">표준입학허가서</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&rsquo; </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">발급</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">학생은 비자신청을 위한 기타서류들을 중국에 있는 관할 한국영사관를 통해 확인하여 준비 후 직접 중국관할 한국영사관에 방문하여 심사를 받아야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">.&nbsp;<span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p></span>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">3. 제출서류</span></p>
