<p class="0" style="text-align: left;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">1) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">합격증 사본</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">등록금 납부 영수증 사본</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
