<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 150%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">2) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">최종학력인증서류 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">원본</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 150%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국인은 중국교육부 학력</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&middot;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">학위인증센터 발행 학위 인증서 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문 발급</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">이어야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 150%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><a href="http://www.chsi.com.cn/"><u style="text-underline: #0000ff single;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">http://www.chsi.com.cn</span></u></a><span style="color: rgb(242, 47, 34); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;"> </span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">또는 </span><a href="http://www.cdgdc.edu.cn/"><u style="text-underline: #0000ff single;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">http://www.cdgdc.edu.cn/</span></u></a></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 150%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">우리대학 석사학위 입학자 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국 학사학위 졸업증명 제출</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 150%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">우리대학 박사학위 입학자 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국 석사학위 졸업증명 제출</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
