<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 31px; height: 57px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">□</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 630px; height: 57px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">3) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">최종학력 성적증명서 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">원본</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">우리대학 석사학위 입학자 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국 학사학위 성적증명서 제출 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">우리대학 박사학위 입학자 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">중국 석사학위 성적증명서 제출 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 31px; height: 61px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;">□</span></p></td> 
<td style="padding: 1px 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 630px; height: 61px; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">4) </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">은행잔고증명서 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">영문</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">원본</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">본인</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">/</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">부모 명의 계좌만 가능</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * USD 18,000</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">달러 이상 증명해야 함</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">. (</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">발급일 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">개월 이내 서류만 인정</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
