<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 140%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">직위</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">수입</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">직장주소</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">직장 전화번호</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">직장 직인 반드시 포함</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 140%;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style="font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;">개인사업자인 경우 사업자등록증 및 재산세 과세증명서 제출</span></p></td> 
